                                "sense_id": "a7014c35-3925-3ed1-9f85-7527af720080",
                                "text": "It says the station's four ticket office windows were closed, with passengers directed to the five ticket machines, which \"resulted in chaos\". The TSSA reported: \"Within four minutes the queues were unmanageable, and the ticket office was forced to reopen for customers, who were said to be unimpressed.\""
